# =============================================================================
# ModelfileSGLang — SGLang server config for Qwen3.6-27B Q8_0
# =============================================================================
#
# PURPOSE
#   Documents the SGLang server launch parameters that mirror ModelfileHf.
#   SGLang is not Ollama — there is no "Modelfile" concept. This file is
#   documentation for build_sglang.sh and a reference for reproducing the
#   server config exactly.
#
# QUICK START
#   bash /home/user/determ/build_sglang.sh
#
# WHAT THIS CONFIG DOES (vs ModelfileHf)
#
#   ModelfileHf parameter     → SGLang equivalent
#   ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   FROM ./Qwen3.6-27B-Q8_0.gguf  → --model-path ./Qwen3.6-27B-Q8_0.gguf
#   PARAMETER num_ctx 131072       → --context-length 131072
#   PARAMETER num_gpu 99           → --tensor-parallel-size 2
#   PARAMETER temperature 0.6      → per-request (sampling default in .env)
#   PARAMETER top_p 0.95           → per-request (sampling default in .env)
#   PARAMETER min_p 0.05           → per-request (no direct --min-p; set via API)
#   PARAMETER repeat_last_n 1024   → --no-slidewindow-attn (use full context)
#
#   New SGLang capabilities not available in Ollama:
#     --enable-thinking             enables Qwen3.6 thinking mode (budget_tokens param)
#     --reasoning-parser qwen3      parses <think>…</think> into reasoning_content
#     --mem-fraction-static 0.88    reserves 88% of VRAM for KV cache radix tree
#     --chunked-prefill-size 4096   chunked prefill for long prompts
#     --max-running-requests 4      limits concurrent decodes to protect KV cache
#
# VRAM BUDGET (dual RTX 3090, 48 GB total)
#   28.6 GB  model weights (Q8_0, split across 2× GPU via tensor parallel)
#   ~8.4 GB  KV radix cache (88% of remaining ~9.5 GB after weights)
#   ~1.1 GB  runtime / CUDA overhead
#   -------
#   ~38 GB   total — 10 GB headroom
#
# WHY SGLang OVER OLLAMA FOR THIS PIPELINE
#   1. RadixAttention: trie-based token-level KV cache reuse.
#      The TASK 0c fix loop sends the same ~40k-char system prompt on every
#      attempt. With Ollama these tokens are re-computed each call. SGLang
#      reuses them from the radix cache → fix loop calls are ~3× faster.
#   2. thinking_budget parameter: controls per-request reasoning token budget.
#      Eliminates the "model exhausted output on thinking, returned empty"
#      failure mode that required a two-turn recovery hack in OllamaBackend.
#   3. OpenAI-compatible /v1/chat/completions — drop-in for the compat path.
#      reasoning_content is returned as a separate field (not mixed into content).
#
# SERVER URL
#   Default: http://localhost:30000
#   Set SGLANG_BASE_URL in .env to override.
#
# SERVED MODEL NAME
#   --served-model-name qwen3.6-27b-q8
#   Must match SGLANG_MODEL_NAME in .env.
# =============================================================================

